# Kostel Frontend environment
# The SPA runs entirely in the browser; in dev, Vite proxies /api to the BE.
# Usually no env vars are needed. If you add feature flags, copy this file to
# .env.local and adjust. Vite only exposes vars prefixed with VITE_.

# Example:
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:4000
#GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=your-google-client-id-here
#GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=your-google-client-secret-here
#GOOGLE_CALLBACK_URL=http://localhost:4000/api/auth/google/callback
#FRONTEND_URL=http://localhost:4008